	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Audio te, fili, remissiorem esse in studiis, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>qua re nihil audire possem molestum aeque.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z3"/>Qui enim boni temporis prodigus est, in studiis <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>bonarum literarum friget.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">At prodig te esse optim<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>i <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>temporis id imprimis redarguit, quod nimis <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>frequenter tu et reliqui nostri studiosi <placeName ref="l587">Tigurini</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>convenitis.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Societas quidem inhonesta non <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>est; quae vero studia impediunt, inhonesta esse incipi<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>unt studiosis.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Verum quid argumentatione illa <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>opus est?</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">An tu ita institutus es?</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Lege, lege or[o], <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>quid manu mea scripta institutio habeat de iactura <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>temporis, de dividendis horis ad literarum <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>studia.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Volat irrevocabile tempus; tu vero omni <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>momento appropinquas tempori, quo domum <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>es revocandus; neque enim ego tantis sumptibus <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>ferendis suffecero.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Ubi redieris, reposcetur a te <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>diligenti examine, quid profeceris in lingua <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Latina et Graeca, in dialectica, rhetorica, in <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>historia et poesi, in theologia etc.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Vide ergo, qu[<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>id] agas; cave, ne tantillum tibi temporis pereat, [quod] <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>studio non impenderis.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de">Ir dörffend nüt im<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>merdar zuͦ zamen schlüffen und rennen; sitzend <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>still und studierend.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="de">Ir sind nitt <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>darumb ußgeschickt, das ir spatzierind, gsellschafften <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>leistind, zamen renind etc.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Ac tibi nunc per <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>hasce literas demando, ut relicto illo sodalitio <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>et frequentibus conventibus tuas res agas, temporis <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>rationem habeas.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Illis ipsis tuis sodalibus <lb xml:id="p1z30"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinis</placeName> studiosis idem denuncies.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Scio te <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>domino vel hero tuo rem ingratam facere.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Volo <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>ergo, ut non egrediaris aedes eius neque <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>ullos in aedes eius introducas, nisi id fiat cum bona <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>eius gratia, et ut illi per omnia obedias, de qua re <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>et ad ipsum quaedam scripsi.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Volo item, ut <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>per hunc mercatorem Italum, virum bonum et amicum meum <lb xml:id="p1z37"/><persName ref="p8186">Franciscum Bonet</persName>, mihi respondeas cum ad <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>has meas literas tum etiam ad priores.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de">Söltist <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>mir hinab in <placeName ref="l749">Saxen</placeName> kummen oder in <placeName ref="l213">Hessen</placeName> und <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>wöltist mir so xellig sin, da wurde ich rächt <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>mitt dir verfaren sin.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Cogita te propediem rev<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>ocandum et examinandum; vide ne sumptus in te fe<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>cerim sine fructu; vide, ut redeas cum gaudio <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>parentum, sororum et affinium ac amicorum.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Haec volo memori mente reponas.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>ultima iunii anno 1555.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p487">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName> iuniori, filio meo, in a<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>edibus optimi viri d. <persName ref="p505">Ioannis Burcheri</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z7"/><placeName ref="l491">Argentinae</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
